{"id":"5db3fa00f537080b","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-congruence-powers.md","title":"Congruence of Powers","display":"Congruence of Powers","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-congruence-powers","aliases":["93-prop-congruence-powers"],"display":"Congruence of Powers","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-powers]]","[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]","[[93-fact-powers-congruence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-congruence-powers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-congruence-powers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Congruence of Powers"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"52c2a3857da7da70\" href=\"?note=52c2a3857da7da70\" title=\"93-fact-powers-congruence\">93-fact-powers-congruence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-congruence-powers-—-Congruence-of-Powers\">prop-congruence-powers — Congruence of Powers</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta \\in \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})\">\\(\\theta \\in \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})\\)</span> is a congruence on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{A}\">\\(\\mathbf{A}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is an arbitrary set and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> is the coordinatewise lift of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52c2a3857da7da70\" href=\"?note=52c2a3857da7da70\" title=\"93-fact-powers-congruence\">93-fact-powers-congruence</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> are the predicates/constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-indexed quotient constructor of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau))\\land\n\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\Bigl(h,\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau),\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A};\\tau),\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau),I;\\tau)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau))\\land\n\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\Bigl(h,\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau),\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A};\\tau),\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau),I;\\tau)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The power of a congruence is a congruence on the power algebra, and the quotient of a power by the power of a congruence is isomorphic to the power of quotients.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-congruence-powers-—-Congruence-of-Powers","text":"prop-congruence-powers — Congruence of Powers","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"r