/constructors of [[93-df-powers]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}$ is the type-indexed quotient constructor of [[93-df-quotient-algebra]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta \\in \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{A}","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\n\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\to\n\\Bigl[\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A}\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau))\\land\n\\exists h\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\Bigl(h,\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I;\\tau),\\theta^I_{\\mathbf A};\\tau),\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\theta;\\tau),I;\\tau)\\Bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1597,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","30b341bfbd8b5301","10bfe2126b30365e","260c377f5e1dcfdf","510bd94349c4c6d9","fe06c83d404633c2","52c2a3857da7da70"]}